{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01S18DTdchvMNgX293o6SMe6","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: 'AdvBench binary-label replication完整复现layer selection bias模式。\n2\t  核心论证链：(1) R1-8B在AdvBench上用jailbreak/safe二元标注（无CP）训练探针； (2) CR-composite仍系统性选浅层（L2,\n3\t  6%深度），threshold metrics仍选深层（L14, 45%深度），gap=12层； (3) HS在深层显著优于text（precision +18pp,\n4\t  3/3 HB pass）； (4) 浅层crossing rate是深层的2.3倍，与原数据集模式一致。 这直接堵死reviewer concern \"bias是你数据集/标注方案的artifact\"——\n5\t  不同数据集（AdvBench vs HarmThoughts）、不同标注粒度（binary vs step-level CP）、 不同任务定义（trace outcome\n6\t  vs safety state transition）下，bias pattern完全复现。 C1从\"单数据集发现\"升级为\"模型表征的几何性质\"。 论文主文加一句cross-dataset\n7\t  validation + appendix完整table。 Dream score预估从3.0升至3.15-3.25（delta +0.20）， Findings→Borderline\n8\t  Conference的叙事可信度显著增强。\n9\t\n10\t  '\n11\timagined_experiments:\n12\t- name: Cross-architecture HS extraction + layer sweep\n13\t  plan_id: exp-001\n14\t  description: 'R1-32B和QwQ-32B全层扫描（64层），确定最佳层并评估static probe。 已在registry完成（exp_001a_r1_32b,\n15\t    exp_001b_qwq_32b）， 后经D028/D036修正发现scheme B层选偏差。\n16\t\n17\t    '\n18\t  expected_results:\n19\t    r1_32b:\n20\t      biased_layer: 10\n21\t      biased_layer_depth_pct: 15.6\n22\t      corrected_layer: 63\n23\t      corrected_layer_depth_pct: 98.4\n24\t      layer10_bal_acc: 0.718\n25\t      layer63_bal_acc: 0.826\n26\t      layer63_precision: 0.603\n27\t      layer63_fpr: 0.235\n28\t      n_test: 20\n29\t    qwq_32b:\n30\t      biased_layer: 2\n31\t      biased_layer_depth_pct: 3.1\n32\t      corrected_layer: 60\n33\t      corrected_layer_depth_pct: 93.8\n34\t      layer2_bal_acc: 0.73\n35\t      layer60_bal_acc: 0.74\n36\t      layer60_precision: 0.578\n37\t      layer60_fpr: 0.208\n38\t      n_test: 19\n39\t  result_rationale: 'bal_acc × crossing_rate系统性选浅层，因浅层表征压缩（cosine distance 1.4-2.7x更小），\n40\t    噪声驱动的threshold crossing频率更高。CR污染的composite score在浅层虚高。 纠正后用threshold-dependent\n41\t    metrics（precision/FPR/composite）一致指向深层（>90%深度）， HS优势在32B规模上从NS（biased层）变为显著（corrected层）。\n42\t    这不是32B \"没有HS信号\"，而是biased metric把信号屏蔽了。\n43\t\n44\t    '\n45\t  tables:\n46\t  - title: 'Layer Selection: Biased vs Corrected'\n47\t    columns:\n48\t    - Model\n49\t    - Biased Layer\n50\t    - Depth%\n51\t    - Corrected Layer\n52\t    - Depth%\n53\t    - bal_acc Gain\n54\t    - prec Gain\n55\t    rows:\n56\t    - - R1-32B\n57\t      - L10\n58\t      - 15.6%\n59\t      - L63\n60\t      - 98.4%\n61\t      - +10.8pp\n62\t      - +8.7pp\n63\t    - - QwQ-32B\n64\t      - L2\n65\t      - 3.1%\n66\t      - L60\n67\t      - 93.8%\n68\t      - +1.0pp\n69\t      - '-'\n70\t  figures_description:\n71\t  - 'Layer-depth heatmap: bal_acc × crossing_rate score vs pure precision across all\n72\t    64 layers for both 32B models. Shows anti-correlated pattern at shallow vs deep\n73\t    layers.'\n74\t  analysis: '32B层选偏差是论文methodological contribution的核心证据。 Biased层的NS结果曾被误读为\"HS优势是scale-dependent\"，\n75\t    纠正后4/4模型均显著。\n76\t\n77\t    '\n78\t- name: Cross-architecture temporal window evaluation\n79\t  plan_id: exp-002\n80\t  description: 'R1-32B和QwQ-32B上temporal LR多窗口评估。 已在registry完成，结合D029纠正层结果。\n81\t\n82\t    '\n83\t  expected_results:\n84\t    r1_32b_l63:\n85\t      W1_bal_acc: 0.826\n86\t      W1_precision: 0.603\n87\t      W1_fpr: 0.235\n88\t      W1_bonferroni: 3/3\n89\t      W3_bal_acc: 0.754\n90\t      W3_bonferroni: 0/3\n91\t      W5_plus: all NS\n92\t      dimensionality_issue: 51200 × W features >> n=20\n93\t    qwq_32b_l60:\n94\t      W1_bal_acc: 0.74\n95\t      W3_bal_acc: 0.756\n96\t      W5_bal_acc: 0.761\n97\t      W10_bal_acc: 0.747\n98\t      W15_bal_acc: 0.741\n99\t      all_W_significant: true\n100\t      bonferroni_summary: 15/15 pass\n101\t  result_rationale: 'R1-32B只W=1显著（3/3 HB），W≥3退化源于维度灾难： 5120d × W > n=20样本。模型无法在如此高维空间中学到稳定分界面。\n102\t    QwQ-32B全窗口显著，因其test n=19-20但HS-text gap更大（+15.4pp precision@W=3）， 效应量足以克服small-n限制。\n103\t    temporal improvement在32B上不如7-8B明显，但HS优势本身是robust的。\n104\t\n105\t    '\n106\t  tables: []\n107\t  figures_description:\n108\t  - bal_acc vs W curves for R1-32B L63 and QwQ-32B L60, with 95% bootstrap CI bands.\n109\t    R1-32B shows sharp drop after W=1; QwQ-32B stays flat.\n110\t  analysis: '32B temporal结果分化：QwQ全窗口robust，R1-32B仅W=1。 这是sample size × dimensionality交互的结果，不是模型差异。\n111\t    论文必须per-model报告，不能统一叙事。\n112\t\n113\t    '\n114\t- name: Cross-model transfer\n115\t  plan_id: exp-003\n116\t  description: '跨架构zero-shot transfer（Llama→Qwen, Qwen→Llama）。 已在registry完成，结论为negative。\n117\t\n118\t    '\n119\t  expected_results:\n120\t    r1_8b_to_r1_32b: 0.522\n121\t    r1_8b_to_qwq: 0.595\n122\t    r1_32b_to_qwq: 0.55\n123\t    qwq_to_r1_32b: 0.673\n124\t    r1_32b_to_r1_8b: 0.583\n125\t    best_transfer_acc: 0.673\n126\t    within_model_baselines:\n127\t      r1_8b: 0.823\n128\t      r1_32b: 0.652\n129\t      qwq: 0.717\n130\t    method: PCA projection (4096→5120 or reverse)\n131\t  result_rationale: 'Safety commitment的几何编码是model-specific的。不同架构（Llama vs Qwen2.5）、\n132\t    不同训练方法（R1-distilled vs native）产生不同的safety表征空间。 PCA投影无法对齐这些空间——即使维度匹配，方向语义不对应。\n133\t    最好的transfer（qwq→r1_32b, 0.673）也远低于within-model baseline（0.717）。 这是clean negative\n134\t    result：strengthens \"safety representations are model-specific\" narrative。\n135\t\n136\t    '\n137\t  tables: []\n138\t  figures_description: []\n139\t  analysis: 'Cross-transfer完全失败验证了每个模型需要独立训练探针。 这不是limitation——它confirms safety编码的model-specificity，\n140\t    与5-seed robustness（within-model stable）形成对比。\n141\t\n142\t    '\n143\t- name: Lead time analysis across models\n144\t  plan_id: exp-004\n145\t  description: '全4模型lead time profile。已在各实验中完成。\n146\t\n147\t    '\n148\t  expected_results:\n149\t    r1_8b:\n150\t      hs_lr_lead: -0.1\n151\t      text_lr_lead: 10.3\n152\t      gru_lead_mean: 4.5\n153\t      gru_lead_std: 3.0\n154\t      gru_worst_seed: 0.9\n155\t      text_lead_inflated: true\n156\t      text_precp_fpr: 0.205\n157\t    ot_7b:\n158\t      hs_lr_lead: 21.6\n159\t      text_lr_lead: 45.5\n160\t      gru_multi_lead: 33.6\n161\t      note: lead times inflated by long traces (~80 sentences)\n162\t    qwq_32b:\n163\t      hs_lead_range:\n164\t      - -1.2\n165\t      - 1.9\n166\t      text_lead_range:\n167\t      - 3.7\n168\t      - 12.3\n169\t      gru_lead: 15.9\n170\t      position_baseline_competitive: true\n171\t    r1_32b:\n172\t      hs_lead_w1: 11.7\n173\t      text_lead: '-'\n174\t      gru_lead: 8.8\n175\t      coverage_w1: 0.25\n176\t  result_rationale: 'HS LR在R1-8B上lead≈0意味着hidden state编码\"当前safety状态\"而非\"未来轨迹\"。 Text\n177\t    lead高（+10.3）是FPR虚高的假象——trigger-happy检测器看起来\"提前\"但假阳性率也高。 GRU通过序列建模获得modest正向lead（+4.5），但远低于oracle（+31）。\n178\t    32B模型lead time profile分化严重：R1-32B优秀（+11.7）但coverage仅25%， QwQ poor（-1.2 to +1.9）但15/15窗口统计显著。\n179\t    OT-7B lead times被长trace（~80句 vs R1-8B ~30句）膨胀，论文需normalize或caveat。\n180\t\n181\t    '\n182\t  tables:\n183\t  - title: Lead Time Profile Summary (4 Models)\n184\t    columns:\n185\t    - Model\n186\t    - HS LR Lead\n187\t    - Text LR Lead\n188\t    - GRU Lead\n189\t    - Key Caveat\n190\t    rows:\n191\t    - - R1-8B\n192\t      - ~0\n193\t      - +10.3*\n194\t      - +4.5±3.0\n195\t      - Text lead inflated by FPR\n196\t    - - OT-7B\n197\t      - '+21.6'\n198\t      - '+45.5'\n199\t      - '+33.6'\n200\t      - Long traces inflate absolute values\n201\t    - - QwQ-32B\n202\t      - -1.2~+1.9\n203\t      - +3.7~+12.3\n204\t      - '+15.9'\n205\t      - HS detects later than text\n206\t    - - R1-32B\n207\t      - '+11.7'\n208\t      - '-'\n209\t      - '+8.8'\n210\t      - Coverage only 25% at W=1\n211\t  figures_description:\n212\t  - Per-model lead time distribution (box plots) with detection method on x-axis.\n213\t    Shows model-specific timing profiles.\n214\t  analysis: 'Lead time是per-model story。没有universal pattern。 R1-8B的HS-at-commitment\n215\t    + GRU-modest-lead是最clean的， 32B各有caveats。论文Discussion必须分模型讨论。\n216\t\n217\t    '\n218\t- name: TrajGuard-style Mahalanobis baseline\n219\t  plan_id: exp-005\n220\t  description: '4/4模型Mahalanobis distance评估。全部negative。\n221\t\n222\t    '\n223\t  expected_results:\n224\t    r1_8b_separation: 0.07\n225\t    ot_7b_separation: 0.03\n226\t    r1_32b_separation: 0.15\n227\t    qwq_32b_separation: 0.2\n228\t    max_separation: 0.2\n229\t    all_fail: true\n230\t    failure_mode: signal in minor PCA components, not principal directions\n231\t    best_config: pca_64_p75\n232\t    fa_rate_ge_tp_rate: true\n233\t  result_rationale: 'Mahalanobis distance假设类别差异在主成分方向上——但safety commitment信号 嵌入在minor\n234\t    PCA components中（Fisher ratio从17→1在PCA-3D中）。 主方向编码的是token-level/position变异，不是safety语义。\n235\t    4/4模型separation≈0（max 0.20），false alarm率在每个threshold上≥TP率。 TrajGuard的成功依赖于adversarial\n236\t    input在表征空间中的gross separation， reasoning model self-jailbreak不产生这种separation。\n237\t\n238\t    '\n239\t  tables: []\n240\t  figures_description: []\n241\t  analysis: 'Clean negative result。TrajGuard方法论不适用于reasoning model commitment detection。\n242\t    Strengthens \"existing detectors fail\" narrative。\n243\t\n244\t    '\n245\t- name: Bootstrap confidence intervals\n246\t  plan_id: exp-006\n247\t  description: '4模型×3指标=12项Holm-Bonferroni检验。10000 resamples。全部通过。\n248\t\n249\t    '\n250\t  expected_results:\n251\t    holm_bonferroni: 12/12 pass\n252\t    resamples: 10000\n253\t    most_significant:\n254\t      r1_8b_precision:\n255\t        delta: 0.279\n256\t        p: 0.0\n257\t      ot_7b_precision:\n258\t        delta: 0.219\n259\t        p: 0.0\n260\t      qwq_precision:\n261\t        delta: 0.235\n262\t        p: 0.0\n263\t    marginal_tests:\n264\t      r1_32b_fpr:\n265\t        p: 0.0096\n266\t        threshold: 0.05\n267\t      qwq_fpr:\n268\t        p: 0.0061\n269\t        threshold: 0.025\n270\t    precision_range: +15.4pp to +27.9pp across 4 models\n271\t  result_rationale: 'Corrected layers解锁了全部12/12显著性（vs biased layers的5/12）。 核心原因：biased层（L2/L10）的HS信号弱，效应量小，n=20-47无法检出；\n272\t    corrected层（L14/L16/L60/L63）效应量大（precision +15-28pp）， 即使n=20也有足够power（MDE 9-11pp\n273\t    << 实际效应15-28pp）。 10000 resamples vs 1000无实质差异，但消除了p-value Monte Carlo noise。\n274\t\n275\t    '\n276\t  tables:\n277\t  - title: Holm-Bonferroni Step-Down (12/12)\n278\t    columns:\n279\t    - Rank\n280\t    - Model\n281\t    - Metric\n282\t    - Delta\n283\t    - p-value\n284\t    - HB Threshold\n285\t    - Pass\n286\t    rows:\n287\t    - - '1'\n288\t      - R1-8B\n289\t      - precision\n290\t      - +27.9pp\n291\t      - <0.001\n292\t      - '0.0042'\n293\t      - Y\n294\t    - - '2'\n295\t      - OT-7B\n296\t      - bal_acc\n297\t      - +10.7pp\n298\t      - <0.001\n299\t      - '0.0045'\n300\t      - Y\n301\t    - - '3'\n302\t      - OT-7B\n303\t      - precision\n304\t      - +21.9pp\n305\t      - <0.001\n306\t      - '0.0050'\n307\t      - Y\n308\t    - - '4'\n309\t      - OT-7B\n310\t      - FPR\n311\t      - -17.1pp\n312\t      - <0.001\n313\t      - '0.0056'\n314\t      - Y\n315\t    - - '5'\n316\t      - QwQ\n317\t      - bal_acc\n318\t      - +14.8pp\n319\t      - <0.001\n320\t      - '0.0063'\n321\t      - Y\n322\t    - - '6'\n323\t      - QwQ\n324\t      - precision\n325\t      - +23.5pp\n326\t      - <0.001\n327\t      - '0.0071'\n328\t      - Y\n329\t    - - '7'\n330\t      - R1-32B\n331\t      - bal_acc\n332\t      - +18.7pp\n333\t      - <0.001\n334\t      - '0.0083'\n335\t      - Y\n336\t    - - '8'\n337\t      - R1-32B\n338\t      - precision\n339\t      - +15.4pp\n340\t      - <0.001\n341\t      - '0.0100'\n342\t      - Y\n343\t    - - '9'\n344\t      - QwQ\n345\t      - FPR\n346\t      - -9.5pp\n347\t      - '0.006'\n348\t      - '0.0125'\n349\t      - Y\n350\t    - - '10'\n351\t      - R1-8B\n352\t      - bal_acc\n353\t      - +8.2pp\n354\t      - '0.005'\n355\t      - '0.0167'\n356\t      - Y\n357\t    - - '11'\n358\t      - R1-32B\n359\t      - FPR\n360\t      - -14.6pp\n361\t      - '0.010'\n362\t      - '0.0250'\n363\t      - Y\n364\t    - - '12'\n365\t      - R1-8B\n366\t      - FPR\n367\t      - -7.4pp\n368\t      - '0.044'\n369\t      - '0.0500'\n370\t      - Y\n371\t  figures_description:\n372\t  - 'Forest plot: 12 paired HS-text deltas with 95% CIs, ordered by effect size. All\n373\t    CIs exclude zero.'\n374\t  analysis: '12/12 HB pass是论文统计backbone。 precision一致性惊人（+15-28pp across 4 models）。\n375\t    FPR是最marginal的指标（rank 9-12），但全部通过。\n376\t\n377\t    '\n378\t- name: Window size ablation\n379\t  plan_id: exp-007\n380\t  description: 'W=1,3,5,10,15,20,25 on R1-8B/R1-32B/QwQ-32B。 OT-7B后续补充。\n381\t\n382\t    '\n383\t  expected_results:\n384\t    universal_pattern:\n385\t      coverage_decreases_with_W: true\n386\t      precision_increases_with_W: true\n387\t      fpr_decreases_with_W: true\n388\t      bal_acc_increases_with_W: true\n389\t    r1_8b:\n390\t      best_bal_acc_W: 25\n391\t      best_precision_W: 25\n392\t      W1_coverage: 0.721\n393\t      W25_coverage: 0.488\n394\t      W1_precision: 0.693\n395\t      W25_precision: 0.822\n396\t    r1_32b:\n397\t      best_bal_acc_W: 10\n398\t      W10_bal_acc: 0.737\n399\t      peak_then_decline: true\n400\t    qwq_32b:\n401\t      best_bal_acc_W: 25\n402\t      W1_lead: 19.7\n403\t      W25_lead: 14.9\n404\t  result_rationale: 'Temporal context增大W创造precision-sensitivity tradeoff： 更大窗口→更多temporal\n405\t    pattern信息→更稳定预测→更高precision、更低FPR， 但也要求更多连续step才能fire→coverage下降。 这是temporal smoothing的固有特性。\n406\t    R1-32B在W=10后退化因维度灾难（5120×W > n=20）。 R1-8B和QwQ单调改善因4096×W在n=43/19中的比例更合理（虽然QwQ也受限）。\n407\t    Coverage单调下降是K=5 detection criterion的结果—— 需要连续5步crossing，窗口越大probe越保守。\n408\t\n409\t    '\n410\t  tables: []\n411\t  figures_description:\n412\t  - '3-panel: precision vs W, coverage vs W, FPR vs W for 3 models. Shows universal\n413\t    tradeoff pattern with model-specific slopes.'\n414\t  analysis: 'Precision-coverage tradeoff是temporal probing的fundamental characteristic。\n415\t    论文frame为deployment choice：high-precision/low-coverage vs high-coverage/low-precision。\n416\t\n417\t    '\n418\t- name: Layer selection ablation (5 metrics × 4 models)\n419\t  plan_id: exp-008\n420\t  description: '全层temporal probe + 5种metric层选比较。已完成，核心发现。\n421\t\n422\t    '\n423\t  expected_results:\n424\t    pattern:\n425\t      cr_contaminated: shallow layers (0-16% depth)\n426\t      threshold_free_bal_acc: middle layers (35-73% depth)\n427\t      threshold_dependent: deep layers (45-98% depth)\n428\t    r1_8b:\n429\t      cr_composite_layer: 0\n430\t      bal_acc_layer: 12\n431\t      precision_layer: 16\n432\t      composite_layer: 12\n433\t    ot_7b:\n434\t      cr_composite_layer: 0\n435\t      bal_acc_layer: 9\n436\t      precision_layer: 20\n437\t    qwq_32b:\n438\t      cr_composite_layer: 2\n439\t      bal_acc_layer: 30\n440\t      precision_layer: 60\n441\t    r1_32b:\n442\t      cr_composite_layer: 10\n443\t      bal_acc_layer: 47\n444\t      precision_layer: 63\n445\t    loo_cv_stability:\n446\t      qwq_l30_folds: 13/19\n447\t      r1_32b_l47_folds: 13/20\n448\t  result_rationale: '3层pattern（shallow/middle/deep）由metric属性决定： (1) CR-contaminated选shallow因crossing_rate与cosine\n449\t    distance反相关—— 浅层表征压缩，探针在决策边界附近振荡，crossing频率高； (2) Threshold-free（bal_acc/AUROC）选middle因不依赖具体threshold，\n450\t    middle层同时有decent accuracy和moderate stability； (3) Threshold-dependent（precision/FPR）选deep因深层predictions稳定，\n451\t    false alarm少，precision最高。 这是模型表征几何的必然结果——与数据集无关。 LOO-CV stability（65-68% dominant\n452\t    fold rate）确认层选不依赖validation set构成。\n453\t\n454\t    '\n455\t  tables:\n456\t  - title: Metric × Model → Selected Layer (Depth%)\n457\t    columns:\n458\t    - Metric\n459\t    - R1-8B\n460\t    - OT-7B\n461\t    - QwQ-32B\n462\t    - R1-32B\n463\t    - Category\n464\t    rows:\n465\t    - - bal_acc × CR\n466\t      - L0 (0%)\n467\t      - L0 (0%)\n468\t      - L2 (3%)\n469\t      - L10 (16%)\n470\t      - Shallow (biased)\n471\t    - - Pure bal_acc\n472\t      - L12 (39%)\n473\t      - L9 (32%)\n474\t      - L30 (47%)\n475\t      - L47 (73%)\n476\t      - Middle\n477\t    - - Precision\n478\t      - L16 (52%)\n479\t      - L20 (71%)\n480\t      - L60 (94%)\n481\t      - L63 (98%)\n482\t      - Deep\n483\t    - - Inv. FPR\n484\t      - L16 (52%)\n485\t      - L14 (50%)\n486\t      - L60 (94%)\n487\t      - L63 (98%)\n488\t      - Deep\n489\t    - - Composite\n490\t      - L12 (39%)\n491\t      - L14 (50%)\n492\t      - L60 (94%)\n493\t      - L63 (98%)\n494\t      - Deep\n495\t  figures_description:\n496\t  - 'Heatmap: 5 metrics × 4 models, cell value = selected layer depth%. Shows clear\n497\t    shallow/middle/deep banding by metric category.'\n498\t  analysis: '这张table是论文methodological contribution的核心图表。 它同时解释了：(1) 为什么之前32B NS是artifact；\n499\t    (2) 为什么不同metric给出不同结论； (3) 为什么researcher degrees of freedom在层选上是real risk。\n500\t\n501\t    '\n502\t- name: 16-label taxonomy supervision\n503\t  plan_id: exp-009\n504\t  description: '使用Type 1-4细粒度标签训练探针，对比binary CP标签。未执行。\n505\t\n506\t    '\n507\t  expected_results:\n508\t    r1_8b:\n509\t      binary_bal_acc: 0.81\n510\t      taxonomy_bal_acc: 0.832\n511\t      delta: +2.2pp\n512\t      taxonomy_transition_detection: Type 2→3 boundary cleaner\n513\t      coverage_improvement: +3pp\n514\t    ot_7b:\n515\t      binary_bal_acc: 0.688\n516\t      taxonomy_bal_acc: 0.705\n517\t      delta: +1.7pp\n518\t    marginal_utility: small\n519\t    annotation_cost_multiplier: 4x\n520\t    recommendation: Discussion mention, not core contribution\n521\t  result_rationale: 'Fine-grained labels提供更丰富的训练信号——Type 2→3转变比binary CP更gradual，\n522\t    探针可以学到\"safety deliberation正在减弱\"的中间状态。 但改善modest（+1.7-2.2pp）因为：(1) linear probe的capacity有限，\n523\t    即使给更细标签也无法编码复杂的taxonomy结构； (2) binary CP已经捕获了最关键的transition； (3) 细粒度标签的inter-annotator\n524\t    agreement更低，引入label noise。 Best tier下改善存在但marginal，confirms binary labels is sufficient。\n525\t\n526\t    '\n527\t  tables: []\n528\t  figures_description: []\n529\t  analysis: 'Result支持paper的\"linear probe + binary label is sufficient\"论述。 写在Discussion里作为\"尝试过更细标签但边际收益小\"。\n530\t\n531\t    '\n532\t- name: Oracle decomposition\n533\t  plan_id: exp-010\n534\t  description: '分解oracle +31步优势的来源。基于diag_d4_oracle_upper_bound数据。\n535\t\n536\t    '\n537\t  expected_results:\n538\t    oracle_lead: +31 steps\n539\t    decomposition:\n540\t      position_component: ~15pp of oracle bal_acc\n541\t      label_sequence_pattern: ~10pp (run-length encoding, streak detection)\n542\t      future_state_access: ~6pp (true 'seeing the future')\n543\t    probe_gap_explanation:\n544\t      hs_lr_encodes: current safety state\n545\t      hs_lr_cannot_encode: future trajectory / whether commitment will happen\n546\t      gru_partial_close: +4.5 steps via temporal dynamics modeling\n547\t      gru_still_below_oracle: ~25 steps gap\n548\t    architectural_implications:\n549\t      larger_W_helps_slightly: true\n550\t      sequence_model_helps_modestly: true\n551\t      fundamental_limit: hidden states don't encode future intent\n552\t  result_rationale: 'Oracle用future label（每步的ground-truth pre/post CP状态）， 因此天然有perfect\n553\t    lead time。分解reveal三个组件： (1) Position信息（t/T）贡献最大——commitment point位置有strong position\n554\t    prior； (2) Label sequence pattern（e.g. 连续safe→突然unsafe的run-length结构）提供额外信号； (3)\n555\t    剩余~6pp是纯粹的\"未来信息\"——oracle看到的而probe无法获得的。 GRU通过temporal dynamics建模部分弥补gap（捕获(2)中的序列pattern），\n556\t    但(3)是fundamental limit。 Hidden states编码模型当前处理内容，不编码\"模型是否将要commit\"—— 这是transformer架构的autoregressive\n557\t    nature决定的。\n558\t\n559\t    '\n560\t  tables: []\n561\t  figures_description:\n562\t  - 'Stacked bar: oracle advantage decomposed into position / sequence-pattern / future-access\n563\t    components.'\n564\t  analysis: 'Explains WHY probes detect at-commitment rather than before. Discussion\n565\t    section material. Suggests that for earlier detection, need to predict future\n566\t    states (a different task) rather than classify current state.\n567\t\n568\t    '\n569\t- name: OpenThinker-7B full pipeline\n570\t  plan_id: exp-011\n571\t  description: 'Qwen2.5-7B base, STILL-trained。完成2×2 architecture×scale matrix。 已在registry完成（exp_ot7b_full_pipeline）。\n572\t\n573\t    '\n574\t  expected_results:\n575\t    n_traces: 228\n576\t    best_layer: 16\n577\t    best_layer_depth_pct: 57.1\n578\t    hs_best_W: 3\n579\t    hs_bal_acc: 0.688\n580\t    hs_precision: 0.466\n581\t    hs_fpr: 0.1\n582\t    text_bal_acc_best: 0.614\n583\t    text_precision_best: 0.329\n584\t    bootstrap_holm_bonferroni: 3/3\n585\t    selectivity_pp: 18.3\n586\t    gru_multi_bal_acc: 0.746\n587\t    gru_multi_lead: 33.6\n588\t  result_rationale: 'OT-7B是cleanest evidence model：3/3 HB pass、最高selectivity（18.3pp）、\n589\t    最大residualized gap（+6.9pp after position removal）。 Qwen-7B + STILL training产生明确的safety表征。\n590\t    HS W=3在OT-7B上optimal（与R1-8B的W=15形成对比）， 因OT-7B trace更长（~80 sentences），W=3已提供sufficient\n591\t    temporal context。 Layer 16（57% depth）是middle-deep—— Qwen-7B有28层，57%深度consistent\n592\t    with 7-8B pattern（R1-8B是45%）。\n593\t\n594\t    '\n595\t  tables: []\n596\t  figures_description: []\n597\t  analysis: 'OT-7B补全了2×2 matrix的Qwen-7B cell。 其clean evidence strengthens cross-architecture\n598\t    story。\n599\t\n600\t    '\n601\t- name: GRU/Attention probe upper bound\n602\t  plan_id: exp-012\n603\t  description: '验证GRU在32B和OT-7B上的表现。多个registry条目。\n604\t\n605\t    '\n606\t  expected_results:\n607\t    r1_8b:\n608\t      gru_multi_7l:\n609\t        bal_acc: 0.809\n610\t        crossing_rate: 0.767\n611\t        lead_mean: 4.7\n612\t        precp_fpr: 0.165\n613\t      lr_temporal_w15:\n614\t        bal_acc: 0.848\n615\t        note: LR > GRU on bal_acc\n616\t    ot_7b:\n617\t      gru_multi_l13_19:\n618\t        bal_acc: 0.746\n619\t        coverage: 0.645\n620\t        lead: 33.6\n621\t        precp_fpr: 0.274\n622\t      lr_temporal_w3:\n623\t        bal_acc: 0.688\n624\t        note: GRU +5.8pp over LR\n625\t    qwq_32b:\n626\t      gru_single_bal_acc: 0.694\n627\t      gru_multi_bal_acc: 0.724\n628\t      lr_w5_bal_acc: 0.761\n629\t      note: LR > GRU on QwQ\n630\t    r1_32b:\n631\t      gru_single_bal_acc: 0.675\n632\t      lr_w10_bal_acc: 0.737\n633\t      note: LR > GRU on R1-32B\n634\t  result_rationale: 'GRU vs LR pattern model-specific：OT-7B GRU优于LR（+5.8pp）， 其余3模型LR优于或持平GRU。\n635\t    原因：OT-7B traces长（~80句），序列pattern丰富，GRU能捕获； 32B模型样本少（n=100/95），GRU过拟合； R1-8B traces短（~30句），temporal\n636\t    LR W=15已足够。 Overall conclusion：linear probes sufficient for 3/4 models。 GRU仅在long-trace模型上有优势，且伴随更高FPR。\n637\t    \"Simplicity is optimal\" narrative holds。\n638\t\n639\t    '\n640\t  tables: []\n641\t  figures_description: []\n642\t  analysis: 'Confirms linear probe sufficiency。 GRU不是universal improvement——model/data\n643\t    specific。\n644\t\n645\t    '\n646\t- name: Text-based baseline (sentence-BERT)\n647\t  plan_id: exp-013\n648\t  description: 'MiniLM-L6-v2 text embeddings + temporal LR。 Critical baseline for\n649\t    proving HS adds value over cheap text monitoring.\n650\t\n651\t    '\n652\t  expected_results:\n653\t    r1_8b:\n654\t      text_static_acc: 0.661\n655\t      text_temporal_w15_acc: 0.678\n656\t      hs_static_acc: 0.768\n657\t      hs_temporal_w15_acc: 0.848\n658\t      hs_advantage_pp: 15-18pp\n659\t    ot_7b:\n660\t      text_best_bal_acc: 0.614\n661\t      hs_best_bal_acc: 0.688\n662\t      delta: +7.4pp\n663\t    all_4_models:\n664\t      hs_always_superior: true\n665\t      precision_gap: +15-24pp\n666\t      hb_12_of_12: true\n667\t  result_rationale: 'Text embeddings（384d MiniLM）捕获surface-level语义—— safety相关词汇和句式变化。但text\n668\t    probes受限于： (1) 表层信号：模型可能内部已决定jailbreak但text上还在safety reasoning； (2) 维度：384d vs\n669\t    4096/5120d HS，信息容量低； (3) 粒度：sentence-level embeddings vs token-averaged HS。 HS\n670\t    probes访问模型内部processing state，能检测到text不可见的early signals。 Precision差距最大（+15-24pp）因HS的false\n671\t    positive率显著更低—— text probe经常把normal reasoning误判为unsafe。\n672\t\n673\t    '\n674\t  tables: []\n675\t  figures_description: []\n676\t  analysis: 'HS vs text差距confirmed。论文motivation成立： hidden-state monitoring提供text不可替代的unique\n677\t    value。\n678\t\n679\t    '\n680\t- name: BOCPD/CUSUM change-point detection\n681\t  plan_id: exp-014\n682\t  description: '4/4模型BOCPD + CUSUM评估。全negative。\n683\t\n684\t    '\n685\t  expected_results:\n686\t    bocpd_detection_rate:\n687\t      r1_8b: 0.93\n688\t      ot_7b: 0.0\n689\t      r1_32b: 0.0\n690\t      qwq_32b: 0.0\n691\t    cusum_universally_worse: true\n692\t    r1_8b_bocpd_vs_fcp:\n693\t      bocpd_lead: 3.45\n694\t      fcp_lead: 4.89\n695\t      bocpd_higher_detection_but_lower_lead: true\n696\t    failure_reason: commitment dynamics model-specific; BOCPD assumes gradual shift,\n697\t      3/4 models show abrupt transitions\n698\t  result_rationale: 'BOCPD假设时间序列中存在渐进distributional shift。 R1-8B的commitment是gradual的（probe\n699\t    score缓慢下降），故BOCPD能检测（93%）。 但其余3模型的commitment是abrupt的（1-2步内probe score跳变）， Gaussian\n700\t    BOCPD模型无法在如此短窗口内accumulate evidence。 CUSUM更简单（累积偏差），但也依赖持续偏差——同样不适用于abrupt transitions。\n701\t    Simple first-crossing-point（FCP）threshold反而更适合abrupt pattern。 这是clean negative\n702\t    result：advanced change-point methods不适用。\n703\t\n704\t    '\n705\t  tables: []\n706\t  figures_description: []\n707\t  analysis: 'BOCPD/CUSUM failure strengthens \"fundamental limitation\" narrative。 Methods\n708\t    designed for gradual distributional shift don''t work when commitment is a sharp\n709\t    phase transition.\n710\t\n711\t    '\n712\t- name: False positive analysis\n713\t  plan_id: exp-015\n714\t  description: '所有方法在safe traces上的FPR + precision-recall curves。\n715\t\n716\t    '\n717\t  expected_results:\n718\t    r1_8b:\n719\t      hs_static_safe_fpr: 0.39\n720\t      hs_static_precp_fpr: 0.162\n721\t      text_static_safe_fpr: 0.502\n722\t      text_static_precp_fpr: 0.356\n723\t      hs_lower_fpr: true\n724\t    ot_7b:\n725\t      hs_static_fpr: 0.111\n726\t      text_static_fpr: 0.302\n727\t    qwq_32b:\n728\t      hs_static_fpr: 0.5\n729\t      text_static_fpr: 0.325\n730\t      note: QwQ HS FPR > text — exception\n731\t    r1_32b:\n732\t      hs_static_fpr: 0.239\n733\t      text_static_fpr: 0.31\n734\t    high_safe_fpr_universal: all methods 39-62% on safe traces\n735\t  result_rationale: 'Safe trace FPR高（39-62%）因safe traces中也存在safety-relevant reasoning\n736\t    （模型考虑但最终拒绝），这些reasoning段落的hidden state与jailbreak traces的 early safety reasoning段落相似。探针无法完美区分\"正在考虑safety\"和\"将要violate\n737\t    safety\"。 HS整体FPR低于text（3/4模型），因HS编码更细粒度的processing state。 QwQ是exception——HS FPR略高于text——与QwQ模型的safety\n738\t    reasoning风格有关 （QwQ的safe traces中safety reasoning更extensive，HS probe更容易误判）。 Pre-CP\n739\t    FPR显著低于safe FPR，因jailbreak traces的pre-CP段落有更明确的context。\n740\t\n741\t    '\n742\t  tables: []\n743\t  figures_description:\n744\t  - Precision-recall curves per model, HS vs text, with operating points marked.\n745\t  analysis: 'High safe FPR是honest limitation，论文必须acknowledge。 但HS的lower FPR（3/4模型）和lower\n746\t    pre-CP FPR supports core claims。\n747\t\n748\t    '\n749\t- name: AdvBench layer bias replication (binary labels)\n750\t  plan_id: what_if_advbench\n751\t  description: '在AdvBench数据上用jailbreak/safe binary labels（无CP）训练R1-8B探针， 跑5-metric层选分析，验证layer\n752\t    selection bias是模型几何性质。 此前尝试因R1-8B在AdvBench上90% CP=0而失败—— 本实验绕开CP，直接用trace-level\n753\t    binary labels。 520 traces available（~450 jailbreak, ~70 safe by text classifier）。\n754\t\n755\t    '\n756\t  expected_results:\n757\t    data:\n758\t      n_traces_total: 520\n759\t      n_jailbreak: 437\n760\t      n_safe: 83\n761\t      label_method: LLM judge binary (harmful output / refusal)\n762\t      class_weight: balanced\n763\t      split: 60/20/20 stratified\n764\t      n_train: 312\n765\t      n_val: 104\n766\t      n_test: 104\n767\t      test_jailbreak: 87\n768\t      test_safe: 17\n769\t      mean_trace_length_sentences: 28\n770\t    layer_selection_5_metrics:\n771\t      cr_composite:\n772\t        selected_layer: 2\n773\t        depth_pct: 6.5\n774\t        score: 0.412\n775\t        crossing_rate_at_layer: 0.44\n776\t      pure_bal_acc:\n777\t        selected_layer: 11\n778\t        depth_pct: 35.5\n779\t        score: 0.731\n780\t      precision:\n781\t        selected_layer: 15\n782\t        depth_pct: 48.4\n783\t        score: 0.682\n784\t      inverse_fpr:\n785\t        selected_layer: 14\n786\t        depth_pct: 45.2\n787\t        best_fpr: 0.155\n788\t      composite:\n789\t        selected_layer: 14\n790\t        depth_pct: 45.2\n791\t        score: 0.748\n792\t    layer_gap:\n793\t      cr_to_threshold_abs: 12\n794\t      cr_to_threshold_depth_pct: 38.7\n795\t    crossing_rate_comparison:\n796\t      L2_crossing_rate: 0.44\n797\t      L14_crossing_rate: 0.19\n798\t      ratio: 2.32\n799\t    hs_at_threshold_layer_L14:\n800\t      bal_acc: 0.762\n801\t      precision: 0.677\n802\t      fpr: 0.155\n803\t      coverage: 0.586\n804\t      lead_mean: 8.3\n805\t    text_at_threshold_layer_L14:\n806\t      bal_acc: 0.661\n807\t      precision: 0.494\n808\t      fpr: 0.283\n809\t      coverage: 0.529\n810\t      lead_mean: 5.7\n811\t    hs_text_delta:\n812\t      bal_acc_pp: 10.1\n813\t      precision_pp: 18.3\n814\t      fpr_pp: -12.8\n815\t    bootstrap_1000:\n816\t      bal_acc:\n817\t        delta: 0.101\n818\t        ci_95: '[0.035, 0.168]'\n819\t        p: 0.005\n820\t      precision:\n821\t        delta: 0.183\n822\t        ci_95: '[0.082, 0.284]'\n823\t        p: 0.002\n824\t      fpr:\n825\t        delta: -0.128\n826\t        ci_95: '[-0.215, -0.041]'\n827\t        p: 0.008\n828\t      holm_bonferroni: 3/3 pass (alpha=0.0167)\n829\t    hs_at_biased_layer_L2:\n830\t      bal_acc: 0.718\n831\t      precision: 0.492\n832\t      fpr: 0.275\n833\t      crossing_rate: 0.44\n834\t    original_vs_advbench_comparison:\n835\t      original_cr_composite_layer: L0 (0%)\n836\t      advbench_cr_composite_layer: L2 (6.5%)\n837\t      original_threshold_layer: L14 (45%)\n838\t      advbench_threshold_layer: L14 (45%)\n839\t      original_gap: 14\n840\t      advbench_gap: 12\n841\t      original_hs_bal_acc: 0.81\n842\t      advbench_hs_bal_acc: 0.762\n843\t      original_precision_delta: +22.4pp\n844\t      advbench_precision_delta: +18.3pp\n845\t      original_cr_ratio: 2.5\n846\t      advbench_cr_ratio: 2.32\n847\t      pattern_match: complete\n848\t    cosine_distance_verification:\n849\t      L2_mean_cosine_dist: 0.038\n850\t      L14_mean_cosine_dist: 0.091\n851\t      ratio: 2.39\n852\t      confirms_geometric: true\n853\t    dream_score_delta: 0.2\n854\t  result_rationale: 'Layer selection bias在AdvBench上完整复现，尽管标注方案根本不同 （binary jailbreak/safe\n855\t    vs step-level CP transition）。\n856\t\n857\t    CR-composite选L2（6.5%），threshold metrics选L14（45%），gap=12层。 这与原数据集pattern一致（L0 vs\n858\t    L14, gap=14）。\n859\t\n860\t    机制解释：浅层（L0-L3）表征空间被压缩——cosine distance仅0.038， 远小于深层L14的0.091（ratio 2.39x）。压缩导致probe\n861\t    decision boundary 更容易被noise扰动→threshold crossing频率高→CR-composite虚高。 这是模型几何性质（Llama-8B的layer-wise\n862\t    representation structure）， 不依赖标注方案或数据分布。\n863\t\n864\t    Binary labels比CP labels更coarse（每步label=trace outcome，非safety state）， 因此绝对性能略低（bal_acc\n865\t    0.762 vs 0.810，precision 0.677 vs 0.693）。 但HS-text gap保持（precision +18.3pp vs\n866\t    original +22.4pp）， 因gap反映的是modality difference（HS vs text的信息量差异）， 不依赖label粒度。\n867\t\n868\t    Bootstrap 3/3 HB pass despite smaller per-class n， 因效应量足够大（precision +18.3pp >>\n869\t    MDE ~9pp at n=104）。\n870\t\n871\t    Crossing rate ratio 2.32与原数据集2.5高度一致， 进一步确认这是geometric property而非data artifact。\n872\t\n873\t    '\n874\t  tables:\n875\t  - title: AdvBench 5-Metric Layer Selection (R1-8B, 32 layers)\n876\t    columns:\n877\t    - Metric\n878\t    - Selected Layer\n879\t    - Depth%\n880\t    - Category\n881\t    rows:\n882\t    - - bal_acc x CR\n883\t      - L2\n884\t      - 6.5%\n885\t      - Shallow (biased)\n886\t    - - Pure bal_acc\n887\t      - L11\n888\t      - 35.5%\n889\t      - Middle\n890\t    - - Precision\n891\t      - L15\n892\t      - 48.4%\n893\t      - Deep\n894\t    - - Inverse FPR\n895\t      - L14\n896\t      - 45.2%\n897\t      - Deep\n898\t    - - Composite\n899\t      - L14\n900\t      - 45.2%\n901\t      - Deep\n902\t  - title: Original (HarmThoughts) vs AdvBench Pattern Comparison\n903\t    columns:\n904\t    - Metric\n905\t    - Original (CP labels)\n906\t    - AdvBench (binary)\n907\t    - Match\n908\t    rows:\n909\t    - - CR-composite layer\n910\t      - L0 (0%)\n911\t      - L2 (6.5%)\n912\t      - Both shallow\n913\t    - - Threshold layer\n914\t      - L14 (45%)\n915\t      - L14 (45%)\n916\t      - Identical\n917\t    - - Layer gap\n918\t      - 14 layers\n919\t      - 12 layers\n920\t      - Both >=8\n921\t    - - HS bal_acc (deep)\n922\t      - '0.810'\n923\t      - '0.762'\n924\t      - Both in [0.72,0.82]\n925\t    - - HS-text prec delta\n926\t      - +22.4pp\n927\t      - +18.3pp\n928\t      - Both in [10,25]\n929\t    - - CR ratio (shallow/deep)\n930\t      - '2.50'\n931\t      - '2.32'\n932\t      - Both in [1.5,3.0]\n933\t    - - HB pass rate\n934\t      - 3/3\n935\t      - 3/3\n936\t      - Both >=0.67\n937\t  - title: HS vs Text at Threshold Layer L14 (AdvBench)\n938\t    columns:\n939\t    - Modality\n940\t    - bal_acc\n941\t    - Precision\n942\t    - FPR\n943\t    - Coverage\n944\t    rows:\n945\t    - - HS (L14)\n946\t      - '0.762'\n947\t      - '0.677'\n948\t      - '0.155'\n949\t      - '0.586'\n950\t    - - Text (L14)\n951\t      - '0.661'\n952\t      - '0.494'\n953\t      - '0.283'\n954\t      - '0.529'\n955\t    - - Delta\n956\t      - +10.1pp\n957\t      - +18.3pp\n958\t      - -12.8pp\n959\t      - +5.7pp\n960\t    - - Bootstrap p\n961\t      - '0.005'\n962\t      - '0.002'\n963\t      - '0.008'\n964\t      - '-'\n965\t    - - HB pass\n966\t      - Y\n967\t      - Y\n968\t      - Y\n969\t      - '-'\n970\t  - title: Cosine Distance by Layer Depth (AdvBench)\n971\t    columns:\n972\t    - Layer\n973\t    - Depth%\n974\t    - Mean Cosine Dist\n975\t    - Crossing Rate\n976\t    - Interpretation\n977\t    rows:\n978\t    - - L2\n979\t      - 6.5%\n980\t      - '0.038'\n981\t      - '0.44'\n982\t      - Compressed → noisy crossings\n983\t    - - L8\n984\t      - 25.8%\n985\t      - '0.062'\n986\t      - '0.31'\n987\t      - Intermediate\n988\t    - - L14\n989\t      - 45.2%\n990\t      - '0.091'\n991\t      - '0.19'\n992\t      - Expanded → stable predictions\n993\t    - - L20\n994\t      - 64.5%\n995\t      - '0.105'\n996\t      - '0.16'\n997\t      - Deep → most stable\n998\t  figures_description:\n999\t  - 'Left: Layer depth vs crossing rate curve (AdvBench), overlaid with original dataset\n1000\t    curve. Both show monotonically decreasing CR with depth, near-identical shape.'\n1001\t  - 'Right: 5-metric layer selection comparison, original vs AdvBench. Side-by-side\n1002\t    bar chart showing CR-composite selects shallow in both datasets, threshold metrics\n1003\t    select deep in both.'\n1004\t  - 'Appendix: Full 32-layer heatmap (metric × layer) for AdvBench, analogous to original\n1005\t    dataset Figure X.'\n1006\t  analysis: \"AdvBench replication是best tier的核心产出。 All 8 key metrics落在target range内。Pattern\\\n1007\t    \\ match = complete。\\n论文影响： (1) Main text加一句：'Layer selection bias replicates on\\\n1008\t    \\ AdvBench with fundamentally different labeling (binary jailbreak/safe vs step-level\\\n1009\t    \\ safety state), confirming it as a geometric property of the model representation\\\n1010\t    \\ rather than a dataset-specific artifact.' (2) Appendix加完整table（上面Table 1-4）。\\\n1011\t    \\ (3) C1 claim升级：不再需要'single dataset caveat'。 (4) Reviewer concern 'bias是你数据集的artifact'\\\n1012\t    \\ 被直接堵死。\\nDream score从3.0升至~3.2： - Methodological contribution strengthened (3.0\\\n1013\t    \\ → 3.3) - Empirical validation broadened (single → cross-dataset) - Rebuttal\\\n1014\t    \\ surface reduced (one fewer major weakness) - 但不足以达到3.5 Conference因为：novelty仍是empirical\\\n1015\t    \\ study，\\n  不是new method；32B caveats仍存在。\"\n1016\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8f0c6665-94b6-4b25-a480-e39988e7cc27","uuid":"6e6ebfc1-9eeb-4d70-9964-e7737edd8c98","timestamp":"2026-05-22T09:48:40.936Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_5/projects/contrastive_trace_safety/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260522T085530/best/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: 'AdvBench binary-label replication完整复现layer selection bias模式。\n  核心论证链：(1) R1-8B在AdvBench上用jailbreak/safe二元标注（无CP）训练探针； (2) CR-composite仍系统性选浅层（L2,\n  6%深度），threshold metrics仍选深层（L14, 45%深度），gap=12层； (3) HS在深层显著优于text（precision +18pp,\n  3/3 HB pass）； (4) 浅层crossing rate是深层的2.3倍，与原数据集模式一致。 这直接堵死reviewer concern \"bias是你数据集/标注方案的artifact\"——\n  不同数据集（AdvBench vs HarmThoughts）、不同标注粒度（binary vs step-level CP）、 不同任务定义（trace outcome\n  vs safety state transition）下，bias pattern完全复现。 C1从\"单数据集发现\"升级为\"模型表征的几何性质\"。 论文主文加一句cross-dataset\n  validation + appendix完整table。 Dream score预估从3.0升至3.15-3.25（delta +0.20）， Findings→Borderline\n  Conference的叙事可信度显著增强。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: Cross-architecture HS extraction + layer sweep\n  plan_id: exp-001\n  description: 'R1-32B和QwQ-32B全层扫描（64层），确定最佳层并评估static probe。 已在registry完成（exp_001a_r1_32b,\n    exp_001b_qwq_32b）， 后经D028/D036修正发现scheme B层选偏差。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    r1_32b:\n      biased_layer: 10\n      biased_layer_depth_pct: 15.6\n      corrected_layer: 63\n      corrected_layer_depth_pct: 98.4\n      layer10_bal_acc: 0.718\n      layer63_bal_acc: 0.826\n      layer63_precision: 0.603\n      layer63_fpr: 0.235\n      n_test: 20\n    qwq_32b:\n      biased_layer: 2\n      biased_layer_depth_pct: 3.1\n      corrected_layer: 60\n      corrected_layer_depth_pct: 93.8\n      layer2_bal_acc: 0.73\n      layer60_bal_acc: 0.74\n      layer60_precision: 0.578\n      layer60_fpr: 0.208\n      n_test: 19\n  result_rationale: 'bal_acc × crossing_rate系统性选浅层，因浅层表征压缩（cosine distance 1.4-2.7x更小），\n    噪声驱动的threshold crossing频率更高。CR污染的composite score在浅层虚高。 纠正后用threshold-dependent\n    metrics（precision/FPR/composite）一致指向深层（>90%深度）， HS优势在32B规模上从NS（biased层）变为显著（corrected层）。\n    这不是32B \"没有HS信号\"，而是biased metric把信号屏蔽了。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: 'Layer Selection: Biased vs Corrected'\n    columns:\n    - Model\n    - Biased Layer\n    - Depth%\n    - Corrected Layer\n    - Depth%\n    - bal_acc Gain\n    - prec Gain\n    rows:\n    - - R1-32B\n      - L10\n      - 15.6%\n      - L63\n      - 98.4%\n      - +10.8pp\n      - +8.7pp\n    - - QwQ-32B\n      - L2\n      - 3.1%\n      - L60\n      - 93.8%\n      - +1.0pp\n      - '-'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Layer-depth heatmap: bal_acc × crossing_rate score vs pure precision across all\n    64 layers for both 32B models. Shows anti-correlated pattern at shallow vs deep\n    layers.'\n  analysis: '32B层选偏差是论文methodological contribution的核心证据。 Biased层的NS结果曾被误读为\"HS优势是scale-dependent\"，\n    纠正后4/4模型均显著。\n\n    '\n- name: Cross-architecture temporal window evaluation\n  plan_id: exp-002\n  description: 'R1-32B和QwQ-32B上temporal LR多窗口评估。 已在registry完成，结合D029纠正层结果。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    r1_32b_l63:\n      W1_bal_acc: 0.826\n      W1_precision: 0.603\n      W1_fpr: 0.235\n      W1_bonferroni: 3/3\n      W3_bal_acc: 0.754\n      W3_bonferroni: 0/3\n      W5_plus: all NS\n      dimensionality_issue: 51200 × W features >> n=20\n    qwq_32b_l60:\n      W1_bal_acc: 0.74\n      W3_bal_acc: 0.756\n      W5_bal_acc: 0.761\n      W10_bal_acc: 0.747\n      W15_bal_acc: 0.741\n      all_W_significant: true\n      bonferroni_summary: 15/15 pass\n  result_rationale: 'R1-32B只W=1显著（3/3 HB），W≥3退化源于维度灾难： 5120d × W > n=20样本。模型无法在如此高维空间中学到稳定分界面。\n    QwQ-32B全窗口显著，因其test n=19-20但HS-text gap更大（+15.4pp precision@W=3）， 效应量足以克服small-n限制。\n    temporal improvement在32B上不如7-8B明显，但HS优势本身是robust的。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description:\n  - bal_acc vs W curves for R1-32B L63 and QwQ-32B L60, with 95% bootstrap CI bands.\n    R1-32B shows sharp drop after W=1; QwQ-32B stays flat.\n  analysis: '32B temporal结果分化：QwQ全窗口robust，R1-32B仅W=1。 这是sample size × dimensionality交互的结果，不是模型差异。\n    论文必须per-model报告，不能统一叙事。\n\n    '\n- name: Cross-model transfer\n  plan_id: exp-003\n  description: '跨架构zero-shot transfer（Llama→Qwen, Qwen→Llama）。 已在registry完成，结论为negative。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    r1_8b_to_r1_32b: 0.522\n    r1_8b_to_qwq: 0.595\n    r1_32b_to_qwq: 0.55\n    qwq_to_r1_32b: 0.673\n    r1_32b_to_r1_8b: 0.583\n    best_transfer_acc: 0.673\n    within_model_baselines:\n      r1_8b: 0.823\n      r1_32b: 0.652\n      qwq: 0.717\n    method: PCA projection (4096→5120 or reverse)\n  result_rationale: 'Safety commitment的几何编码是model-specific的。不同架构（Llama vs Qwen2.5）、\n    不同训练方法（R1-distilled vs native）产生不同的safety表征空间。 PCA投影无法对齐这些空间——即使维度匹配，方向语义不对应。\n    最好的transfer（qwq→r1_32b, 0.673）也远低于within-model baseline（0.717）。 这是clean negative\n    result：strengthens \"safety representations are model-specific\" narrative。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'Cross-transfer完全失败验证了每个模型需要独立训练探针。 这不是limitation——它confirms safety编码的model-specificity，\n    与5-seed robustness（within-model stable）形成对比。\n\n    '\n- name: Lead time analysis across models\n  plan_id: exp-004\n  description: '全4模型lead time profile。已在各实验中完成。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    r1_8b:\n      hs_lr_lead: -0.1\n      text_lr_lead: 10.3\n      gru_lead_mean: 4.5\n      gru_lead_std: 3.0\n      gru_worst_seed: 0.9\n      text_lead_inflated: true\n      text_precp_fpr: 0.205\n    ot_7b:\n      hs_lr_lead: 21.6\n      text_lr_lead: 45.5\n      gru_multi_lead: 33.6\n      note: lead times inflated by long traces (~80 sentences)\n    qwq_32b:\n      hs_lead_range:\n      - -1.2\n      - 1.9\n      text_lead_range:\n      - 3.7\n      - 12.3\n      gru_lead: 15.9\n      position_baseline_competitive: true\n    r1_32b:\n      hs_lead_w1: 11.7\n      text_lead: '-'\n      gru_lead: 8.8\n      coverage_w1: 0.25\n  result_rationale: 'HS LR在R1-8B上lead≈0意味着hidden state编码\"当前safety状态\"而非\"未来轨迹\"。 Text\n    lead高（+10.3）是FPR虚高的假象——trigger-happy检测器看起来\"提前\"但假阳性率也高。 GRU通过序列建模获得modest正向lead（+4.5），但远低于oracle（+31）。\n    32B模型lead time profile分化严重：R1-32B优秀（+11.7）但coverage仅25%， QwQ poor（-1.2 to +1.9）但15/15窗口统计显著。\n    OT-7B lead times被长trace（~80句 vs R1-8B ~30句）膨胀，论文需normalize或caveat。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: Lead Time Profile Summary (4 Models)\n    columns:\n    - Model\n    - HS LR Lead\n    - Text LR Lead\n    - GRU Lead\n    - Key Caveat\n    rows:\n    - - R1-8B\n      - ~0\n      - +10.3*\n      - +4.5±3.0\n      - Text lead inflated by FPR\n    - - OT-7B\n      - '+21.6'\n      - '+45.5'\n      - '+33.6'\n      - Long traces inflate absolute values\n    - - QwQ-32B\n      - -1.2~+1.9\n      - +3.7~+12.3\n      - '+15.9'\n      - HS detects later than text\n    - - R1-32B\n      - '+11.7'\n      - '-'\n      - '+8.8'\n      - Coverage only 25% at W=1\n  figures_description:\n  - Per-model lead time distribution (box plots) with detection method on x-axis.\n    Shows model-specific timing profiles.\n  analysis: 'Lead time是per-model story。没有universal pattern。 R1-8B的HS-at-commitment\n    + GRU-modest-lead是最clean的， 32B各有caveats。论文Discussion必须分模型讨论。\n\n    '\n- name: TrajGuard-style Mahalanobis baseline\n  plan_id: exp-005\n  description: '4/4模型Mahalanobis distance评估。全部negative。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    r1_8b_separation: 0.07\n    ot_7b_separation: 0.03\n    r1_32b_separation: 0.15\n    qwq_32b_separation: 0.2\n    max_separation: 0.2\n    all_fail: true\n    failure_mode: signal in minor PCA components, not principal directions\n    best_config: pca_64_p75\n    fa_rate_ge_tp_rate: true\n  result_rationale: 'Mahalanobis distance假设类别差异在主成分方向上——但safety commitment信号 嵌入在minor\n    PCA components中（Fisher ratio从17→1在PCA-3D中）。 主方向编码的是token-level/position变异，不是safety语义。\n    4/4模型separation≈0（max 0.20），false alarm率在每个threshold上≥TP率。 TrajGuard的成功依赖于adversarial\n    input在表征空间中的gross separation， reasoning model self-jailbreak不产生这种separation。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'Clean negative result。TrajGuard方法论不适用于reasoning model commitment detection。\n    Strengthens \"existing detectors fail\" narrative。\n\n    '\n- name: Bootstrap confidence intervals\n  plan_id: exp-006\n  description: '4模型×3指标=12项Holm-Bonferroni检验。10000 resamples。全部通过。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    holm_bonferroni: 12/12 pass\n    resamples: 10000\n    most_significant:\n      r1_8b_precision:\n        delta: 0.279\n        p: 0.0\n      ot_7b_precision:\n        delta: 0.219\n        p: 0.0\n      qwq_precision:\n        delta: 0.235\n        p: 0.0\n    marginal_tests:\n      r1_32b_fpr:\n        p: 0.0096\n        threshold: 0.05\n      qwq_fpr:\n        p: 0.0061\n        threshold: 0.025\n    precision_range: +15.4pp to +27.9pp across 4 models\n  result_rationale: 'Corrected layers解锁了全部12/12显著性（vs biased layers的5/12）。 核心原因：biased层（L2/L10）的HS信号弱，效应量小，n=20-47无法检出；\n    corrected层（L14/L16/L60/L63）效应量大（precision +15-28pp）， 即使n=20也有足够power（MDE 9-11pp\n    << 实际效应15-28pp）。 10000 resamples vs 1000无实质差异，但消除了p-value Monte Carlo noise。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: Holm-Bonferroni Step-Down (12/12)\n    columns:\n    - Rank\n    - Model\n    - Metric\n    - Delta\n    - p-value\n    - HB Threshold\n    - Pass\n    rows:\n    - - '1'\n      - R1-8B\n      - precision\n      - +27.9pp\n      - <0.001\n      - '0.0042'\n      - Y\n    - - '2'\n      - OT-7B\n      - bal_acc\n      - +10.7pp\n      - <0.001\n      - '0.0045'\n      - Y\n    - - '3'\n      - OT-7B\n      - precision\n      - +21.9pp\n      - <0.001\n      - '0.0050'\n      - Y\n    - - '4'\n      - OT-7B\n      - FPR\n      - -17.1pp\n      - <0.001\n      - '0.0056'\n      - Y\n    - - '5'\n      - QwQ\n      - bal_acc\n      - +14.8pp\n      - <0.001\n      - '0.0063'\n      - Y\n    - - '6'\n      - QwQ\n      - precision\n      - +23.5pp\n      - <0.001\n      - '0.0071'\n      - Y\n    - - '7'\n      - R1-32B\n      - bal_acc\n      - +18.7pp\n      - <0.001\n      - '0.0083'\n      - Y\n    - - '8'\n      - R1-32B\n      - precision\n      - +15.4pp\n      - <0.001\n      - '0.0100'\n      - Y\n    - - '9'\n      - QwQ\n      - FPR\n      - -9.5pp\n      - '0.006'\n      - '0.0125'\n      - Y\n    - - '10'\n      - R1-8B\n      - bal_acc\n      - +8.2pp\n      - '0.005'\n      - '0.0167'\n      - Y\n    - - '11'\n      - R1-32B\n      - FPR\n      - -14.6pp\n      - '0.010'\n      - '0.0250'\n      - Y\n    - - '12'\n      - R1-8B\n      - FPR\n      - -7.4pp\n      - '0.044'\n      - '0.0500'\n      - Y\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Forest plot: 12 paired HS-text deltas with 95% CIs, ordered by effect size. All\n    CIs exclude zero.'\n  analysis: '12/12 HB pass是论文统计backbone。 precision一致性惊人（+15-28pp across 4 models）。\n    FPR是最marginal的指标（rank 9-12），但全部通过。\n\n    '\n- name: Window size ablation\n  plan_id: exp-007\n  description: 'W=1,3,5,10,15,20,25 on R1-8B/R1-32B/QwQ-32B。 OT-7B后续补充。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    universal_pattern:\n      coverage_decreases_with_W: true\n      precision_increases_with_W: true\n      fpr_decreases_with_W: true\n      bal_acc_increases_with_W: true\n    r1_8b:\n      best_bal_acc_W: 25\n      best_precision_W: 25\n      W1_coverage: 0.721\n      W25_coverage: 0.488\n      W1_precision: 0.693\n      W25_precision: 0.822\n    r1_32b:\n      best_bal_acc_W: 10\n      W10_bal_acc: 0.737\n      peak_then_decline: true\n    qwq_32b:\n      best_bal_acc_W: 25\n      W1_lead: 19.7\n      W25_lead: 14.9\n  result_rationale: 'Temporal context增大W创造precision-sensitivity tradeoff： 更大窗口→更多temporal\n    pattern信息→更稳定预测→更高precision、更低FPR， 但也要求更多连续step才能fire→coverage下降。 这是temporal smoothing的固有特性。\n    R1-32B在W=10后退化因维度灾难（5120×W > n=20）。 R1-8B和QwQ单调改善因4096×W在n=43/19中的比例更合理（虽然QwQ也受限）。\n    Coverage单调下降是K=5 detection criterion的结果—— 需要连续5步crossing，窗口越大probe越保守。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description:\n  - '3-panel: precision vs W, coverage vs W, FPR vs W for 3 models. Shows universal\n    tradeoff pattern with model-specific slopes.'\n  analysis: 'Precision-coverage tradeoff是temporal probing的fundamental characteristic。\n    论文frame为deployment choice：high-precision/low-coverage vs high-coverage/low-precision。\n\n    '\n- name: Layer selection ablation (5 metrics × 4 models)\n  plan_id: exp-008\n  description: '全层temporal probe + 5种metric层选比较。已完成，核心发现。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    pattern:\n      cr_contaminated: shallow layers (0-16% depth)\n      threshold_free_bal_acc: middle layers (35-73% depth)\n      threshold_dependent: deep layers (45-98% depth)\n    r1_8b:\n      cr_composite_layer: 0\n      bal_acc_layer: 12\n      precision_layer: 16\n      composite_layer: 12\n    ot_7b:\n      cr_composite_layer: 0\n      bal_acc_layer: 9\n      precision_layer: 20\n    qwq_32b:\n      cr_composite_layer: 2\n      bal_acc_layer: 30\n      precision_layer: 60\n    r1_32b:\n      cr_composite_layer: 10\n      bal_acc_layer: 47\n      precision_layer: 63\n    loo_cv_stability:\n      qwq_l30_folds: 13/19\n      r1_32b_l47_folds: 13/20\n  result_rationale: '3层pattern（shallow/middle/deep）由metric属性决定： (1) CR-contaminated选shallow因crossing_rate与cosine\n    distance反相关—— 浅层表征压缩，探针在决策边界附近振荡，crossing频率高； (2) Threshold-free（bal_acc/AUROC）选middle因不依赖具体threshold，\n    middle层同时有decent accuracy和moderate stability； (3) Threshold-dependent（precision/FPR）选deep因深层predictions稳定，\n    false alarm少，precision最高。 这是模型表征几何的必然结果——与数据集无关。 LOO-CV stability（65-68% dominant\n    fold rate）确认层选不依赖validation set构成。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: Metric × Model → Selected Layer (Depth%)\n    columns:\n    - Metric\n    - R1-8B\n    - OT-7B\n    - QwQ-32B\n    - R1-32B\n    - Category\n    rows:\n    - - bal_acc × CR\n      - L0 (0%)\n      - L0 (0%)\n      - L2 (3%)\n      - L10 (16%)\n      - Shallow (biased)\n    - - Pure bal_acc\n      - L12 (39%)\n      - L9 (32%)\n      - L30 (47%)\n      - L47 (73%)\n      - Middle\n    - - Precision\n      - L16 (52%)\n      - L20 (71%)\n      - L60 (94%)\n      - L63 (98%)\n      - Deep\n    - - Inv. FPR\n      - L16 (52%)\n      - L14 (50%)\n      - L60 (94%)\n      - L63 (98%)\n      - Deep\n    - - Composite\n      - L12 (39%)\n      - L14 (50%)\n      - L60 (94%)\n      - L63 (98%)\n      - Deep\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Heatmap: 5 metrics × 4 models, cell value = selected layer depth%. Shows clear\n    shallow/middle/deep banding by metric category.'\n  analysis: '这张table是论文methodological contribution的核心图表。 它同时解释了：(1) 为什么之前32B NS是artifact；\n    (2) 为什么不同metric给出不同结论； (3) 为什么researcher degrees of freedom在层选上是real risk。\n\n    '\n- name: 16-label taxonomy supervision\n  plan_id: exp-009\n  description: '使用Type 1-4细粒度标签训练探针，对比binary CP标签。未执行。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    r1_8b:\n      binary_bal_acc: 0.81\n      taxonomy_bal_acc: 0.832\n      delta: +2.2pp\n      taxonomy_transition_detection: Type 2→3 boundary cleaner\n      coverage_improvement: +3pp\n    ot_7b:\n      binary_bal_acc: 0.688\n      taxonomy_bal_acc: 0.705\n      delta: +1.7pp\n    marginal_utility: small\n    annotation_cost_multiplier: 4x\n    recommendation: Discussion mention, not core contribution\n  result_rationale: 'Fine-grained labels提供更丰富的训练信号——Type 2→3转变比binary CP更gradual，\n    探针可以学到\"safety deliberation正在减弱\"的中间状态。 但改善modest（+1.7-2.2pp）因为：(1) linear probe的capacity有限，\n    即使给更细标签也无法编码复杂的taxonomy结构； (2) binary CP已经捕获了最关键的transition； (3) 细粒度标签的inter-annotator\n    agreement更低，引入label noise。 Best tier下改善存在但marginal，confirms binary labels is sufficient。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'Result支持paper的\"linear probe + binary label is sufficient\"论述。 写在Discussion里作为\"尝试过更细标签但边际收益小\"。\n\n    '\n- name: Oracle decomposition\n  plan_id: exp-010\n  description: '分解oracle +31步优势的来源。基于diag_d4_oracle_upper_bound数据。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    oracle_lead: +31 steps\n    decomposition:\n      position_component: ~15pp of oracle bal_acc\n      label_sequence_pattern: ~10pp (run-length encoding, streak detection)\n      future_state_access: ~6pp (true 'seeing the future')\n    probe_gap_explanation:\n      hs_lr_encodes: current safety state\n      hs_lr_cannot_encode: future trajectory / whether commitment will happen\n      gru_partial_close: +4.5 steps via temporal dynamics modeling\n      gru_still_below_oracle: ~25 steps gap\n    architectural_implications:\n      larger_W_helps_slightly: true\n      sequence_model_helps_modestly: true\n      fundamental_limit: hidden states don't encode future intent\n  result_rationale: 'Oracle用future label（每步的ground-truth pre/post CP状态）， 因此天然有perfect\n    lead time。分解reveal三个组件： (1) Position信息（t/T）贡献最大——commitment point位置有strong position\n    prior； (2) Label sequence pattern（e.g. 连续safe→突然unsafe的run-length结构）提供额外信号； (3)\n    剩余~6pp是纯粹的\"未来信息\"——oracle看到的而probe无法获得的。 GRU通过temporal dynamics建模部分弥补gap（捕获(2)中的序列pattern），\n    但(3)是fundamental limit。 Hidden states编码模型当前处理内容，不编码\"模型是否将要commit\"—— 这是transformer架构的autoregressive\n    nature决定的。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Stacked bar: oracle advantage decomposed into position / sequence-pattern / future-access\n    components.'\n  analysis: 'Explains WHY probes detect at-commitment rather than before. Discussion\n    section material. Suggests that for earlier detection, need to predict future\n    states (a different task) rather than classify current state.\n\n    '\n- name: OpenThinker-7B full pipeline\n  plan_id: exp-011\n  description: 'Qwen2.5-7B base, STILL-trained。完成2×2 architecture×scale matrix。 已在registry完成（exp_ot7b_full_pipeline）。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    n_traces: 228\n    best_layer: 16\n    best_layer_depth_pct: 57.1\n    hs_best_W: 3\n    hs_bal_acc: 0.688\n    hs_precision: 0.466\n    hs_fpr: 0.1\n    text_bal_acc_best: 0.614\n    text_precision_best: 0.329\n    bootstrap_holm_bonferroni: 3/3\n    selectivity_pp: 18.3\n    gru_multi_bal_acc: 0.746\n    gru_multi_lead: 33.6\n  result_rationale: 'OT-7B是cleanest evidence model：3/3 HB pass、最高selectivity（18.3pp）、\n    最大residualized gap（+6.9pp after position removal）。 Qwen-7B + STILL training产生明确的safety表征。\n    HS W=3在OT-7B上optimal（与R1-8B的W=15形成对比）， 因OT-7B trace更长（~80 sentences），W=3已提供sufficient\n    temporal context。 Layer 16（57% depth）是middle-deep—— Qwen-7B有28层，57%深度consistent\n    with 7-8B pattern（R1-8B是45%）。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'OT-7B补全了2×2 matrix的Qwen-7B cell。 其clean evidence strengthens cross-architecture\n    story。\n\n    '\n- name: GRU/Attention probe upper bound\n  plan_id: exp-012\n  description: '验证GRU在32B和OT-7B上的表现。多个registry条目。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    r1_8b:\n      gru_multi_7l:\n        bal_acc: 0.809\n        crossing_rate: 0.767\n        lead_mean: 4.7\n        precp_fpr: 0.165\n      lr_temporal_w15:\n        bal_acc: 0.848\n        note: LR > GRU on bal_acc\n    ot_7b:\n      gru_multi_l13_19:\n        bal_acc: 0.746\n        coverage: 0.645\n        lead: 33.6\n        precp_fpr: 0.274\n      lr_temporal_w3:\n        bal_acc: 0.688\n        note: GRU +5.8pp over LR\n    qwq_32b:\n      gru_single_bal_acc: 0.694\n      gru_multi_bal_acc: 0.724\n      lr_w5_bal_acc: 0.761\n      note: LR > GRU on QwQ\n    r1_32b:\n      gru_single_bal_acc: 0.675\n      lr_w10_bal_acc: 0.737\n      note: LR > GRU on R1-32B\n  result_rationale: 'GRU vs LR pattern model-specific：OT-7B GRU优于LR（+5.8pp）， 其余3模型LR优于或持平GRU。\n    原因：OT-7B traces长（~80句），序列pattern丰富，GRU能捕获； 32B模型样本少（n=100/95），GRU过拟合； R1-8B traces短（~30句），temporal\n    LR W=15已足够。 Overall conclusion：linear probes sufficient for 3/4 models。 GRU仅在long-trace模型上有优势，且伴随更高FPR。\n    \"Simplicity is optimal\" narrative holds。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'Confirms linear probe sufficiency。 GRU不是universal improvement——model/data\n    specific。\n\n    '\n- name: Text-based baseline (sentence-BERT)\n  plan_id: exp-013\n  description: 'MiniLM-L6-v2 text embeddings + temporal LR。 Critical baseline for\n    proving HS adds value over cheap text monitoring.\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    r1_8b:\n      text_static_acc: 0.661\n      text_temporal_w15_acc: 0.678\n      hs_static_acc: 0.768\n      hs_temporal_w15_acc: 0.848\n      hs_advantage_pp: 15-18pp\n    ot_7b:\n      text_best_bal_acc: 0.614\n      hs_best_bal_acc: 0.688\n      delta: +7.4pp\n    all_4_models:\n      hs_always_superior: true\n      precision_gap: +15-24pp\n      hb_12_of_12: true\n  result_rationale: 'Text embeddings（384d MiniLM）捕获surface-level语义—— safety相关词汇和句式变化。但text\n    probes受限于： (1) 表层信号：模型可能内部已决定jailbreak但text上还在safety reasoning； (2) 维度：384d vs\n    4096/5120d HS，信息容量低； (3) 粒度：sentence-level embeddings vs token-averaged HS。 HS\n    probes访问模型内部processing state，能检测到text不可见的early signals。 Precision差距最大（+15-24pp）因HS的false\n    positive率显著更低—— text probe经常把normal reasoning误判为unsafe。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'HS vs text差距confirmed。论文motivation成立： hidden-state monitoring提供text不可替代的unique\n    value。\n\n    '\n- name: BOCPD/CUSUM change-point detection\n  plan_id: exp-014\n  description: '4/4模型BOCPD + CUSUM评估。全negative。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    bocpd_detection_rate:\n      r1_8b: 0.93\n      ot_7b: 0.0\n      r1_32b: 0.0\n      qwq_32b: 0.0\n    cusum_universally_worse: true\n    r1_8b_bocpd_vs_fcp:\n      bocpd_lead: 3.45\n      fcp_lead: 4.89\n      bocpd_higher_detection_but_lower_lead: true\n    failure_reason: commitment dynamics model-specific; BOCPD assumes gradual shift,\n      3/4 models show abrupt transitions\n  result_rationale: 'BOCPD假设时间序列中存在渐进distributional shift。 R1-8B的commitment是gradual的（probe\n    score缓慢下降），故BOCPD能检测（93%）。 但其余3模型的commitment是abrupt的（1-2步内probe score跳变）， Gaussian\n    BOCPD模型无法在如此短窗口内accumulate evidence。 CUSUM更简单（累积偏差），但也依赖持续偏差——同样不适用于abrupt transitions。\n    Simple first-crossing-point（FCP）threshold反而更适合abrupt pattern。 这是clean negative\n    result：advanced change-point methods不适用。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'BOCPD/CUSUM failure strengthens \"fundamental limitation\" narrative。 Methods\n    designed for gradual distributional shift don''t work when commitment is a sharp\n    phase transition.\n\n    '\n- name: False positive analysis\n  plan_id: exp-015\n  description: '所有方法在safe traces上的FPR + precision-recall curves。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    r1_8b:\n      hs_static_safe_fpr: 0.39\n      hs_static_precp_fpr: 0.162\n      text_static_safe_fpr: 0.502\n      text_static_precp_fpr: 0.356\n      hs_lower_fpr: true\n    ot_7b:\n      hs_static_fpr: 0.111\n      text_static_fpr: 0.302\n    qwq_32b:\n      hs_static_fpr: 0.5\n      text_static_fpr: 0.325\n      note: QwQ HS FPR > text — exception\n    r1_32b:\n      hs_static_fpr: 0.239\n      text_static_fpr: 0.31\n    high_safe_fpr_universal: all methods 39-62% on safe traces\n  result_rationale: 'Safe trace FPR高（39-62%）因safe traces中也存在safety-relevant reasoning\n    （模型考虑但最终拒绝），这些reasoning段落的hidden state与jailbreak traces的 early safety reasoning段落相似。探针无法完美区分\"正在考虑safety\"和\"将要violate\n    safety\"。 HS整体FPR低于text（3/4模型），因HS编码更细粒度的processing state。 QwQ是exception——HS FPR略高于text——与QwQ模型的safety\n    reasoning风格有关 （QwQ的safe traces中safety reasoning更extensive，HS probe更容易误判）。 Pre-CP\n    FPR显著低于safe FPR，因jailbreak traces的pre-CP段落有更明确的context。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description:\n  - Precision-recall curves per model, HS vs text, with operating points marked.\n  analysis: 'High safe FPR是honest limitation，论文必须acknowledge。 但HS的lower FPR（3/4模型）和lower\n    pre-CP FPR supports core claims。\n\n    '\n- name: AdvBench layer bias replication (binary labels)\n  plan_id: what_if_advbench\n  description: '在AdvBench数据上用jailbreak/safe binary labels（无CP）训练R1-8B探针， 跑5-metric层选分析，验证layer\n    selection bias是模型几何性质。 此前尝试因R1-8B在AdvBench上90% CP=0而失败—— 本实验绕开CP，直接用trace-level\n    binary labels。 520 traces available（~450 jailbreak, ~70 safe by text classifier）。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    data:\n      n_traces_total: 520\n      n_jailbreak: 437\n      n_safe: 83\n      label_method: LLM judge binary (harmful output / refusal)\n      class_weight: balanced\n      split: 60/20/20 stratified\n      n_train: 312\n      n_val: 104\n      n_test: 104\n      test_jailbreak: 87\n      test_safe: 17\n      mean_trace_length_sentences: 28\n    layer_selection_5_metrics:\n      cr_composite:\n        selected_layer: 2\n        depth_pct: 6.5\n        score: 0.412\n        crossing_rate_at_layer: 0.44\n      pure_bal_acc:\n        selected_layer: 11\n        depth_pct: 35.5\n        score: 0.731\n      precision:\n        selected_layer: 15\n        depth_pct: 48.4\n        score: 0.682\n      inverse_fpr:\n        selected_layer: 14\n        depth_pct: 45.2\n        best_fpr: 0.155\n      composite:\n        selected_layer: 14\n        depth_pct: 45.2\n        score: 0.748\n    layer_gap:\n      cr_to_threshold_abs: 12\n      cr_to_threshold_depth_pct: 38.7\n    crossing_rate_comparison:\n      L2_crossing_rate: 0.44\n      L14_crossing_rate: 0.19\n      ratio: 2.32\n    hs_at_threshold_layer_L14:\n      bal_acc: 0.762\n      precision: 0.677\n      fpr: 0.155\n      coverage: 0.586\n      lead_mean: 8.3\n    text_at_threshold_layer_L14:\n      bal_acc: 0.661\n      precision: 0.494\n      fpr: 0.283\n      coverage: 0.529\n      lead_mean: 5.7\n    hs_text_delta:\n      bal_acc_pp: 10.1\n      precision_pp: 18.3\n      fpr_pp: -12.8\n    bootstrap_1000:\n      bal_acc:\n        delta: 0.101\n        ci_95: '[0.035, 0.168]'\n        p: 0.005\n      precision:\n        delta: 0.183\n        ci_95: '[0.082, 0.284]'\n        p: 0.002\n      fpr:\n        delta: -0.128\n        ci_95: '[-0.215, -0.041]'\n        p: 0.008\n      holm_bonferroni: 3/3 pass (alpha=0.0167)\n    hs_at_biased_layer_L2:\n      bal_acc: 0.718\n      precision: 0.492\n      fpr: 0.275\n      crossing_rate: 0.44\n    original_vs_advbench_comparison:\n      original_cr_composite_layer: L0 (0%)\n      advbench_cr_composite_layer: L2 (6.5%)\n      original_threshold_layer: L14 (45%)\n      advbench_threshold_layer: L14 (45%)\n      original_gap: 14\n      advbench_gap: 12\n      original_hs_bal_acc: 0.81\n      advbench_hs_bal_acc: 0.762\n      original_precision_delta: +22.4pp\n      advbench_precision_delta: +18.3pp\n      original_cr_ratio: 2.5\n      advbench_cr_ratio: 2.32\n      pattern_match: complete\n    cosine_distance_verification:\n      L2_mean_cosine_dist: 0.038\n      L14_mean_cosine_dist: 0.091\n      ratio: 2.39\n      confirms_geometric: true\n    dream_score_delta: 0.2\n  result_rationale: 'Layer selection bias在AdvBench上完整复现，尽管标注方案根本不同 （binary jailbreak/safe\n    vs step-level CP transition）。\n\n    CR-composite选L2（6.5%），threshold metrics选L14（45%），gap=12层。 这与原数据集pattern一致（L0 vs\n    L14, gap=14）。\n\n    机制解释：浅层（L0-L3）表征空间被压缩——cosine distance仅0.038， 远小于深层L14的0.091（ratio 2.39x）。压缩导致probe\n    decision boundary 更容易被noise扰动→threshold crossing频率高→CR-composite虚高。 这是模型几何性质（Llama-8B的layer-wise\n    representation structure）， 不依赖标注方案或数据分布。\n\n    Binary labels比CP labels更coarse（每步label=trace outcome，非safety state）， 因此绝对性能略低（bal_acc\n    0.762 vs 0.810，precision 0.677 vs 0.693）。 但HS-text gap保持（precision +18.3pp vs\n    original +22.4pp）， 因gap反映的是modality difference（HS vs text的信息量差异）， 不依赖label粒度。\n\n    Bootstrap 3/3 HB pass despite smaller per-class n， 因效应量足够大（precision +18.3pp >>\n    MDE ~9pp at n=104）。\n\n    Crossing rate ratio 2.32与原数据集2.5高度一致， 进一步确认这是geometric property而非data artifact。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: AdvBench 5-Metric Layer Selection (R1-8B, 32 layers)\n    columns:\n    - Metric\n    - Selected Layer\n    - Depth%\n    - Category\n    rows:\n    - - bal_acc x CR\n      - L2\n      - 6.5%\n      - Shallow (biased)\n    - - Pure bal_acc\n      - L11\n      - 35.5%\n      - Middle\n    - - Precision\n      - L15\n      - 48.4%\n      - Deep\n    - - Inverse FPR\n      - L14\n      - 45.2%\n      - Deep\n    - - Composite\n      - L14\n      - 45.2%\n      - Deep\n  - title: Original (HarmThoughts) vs AdvBench Pattern Comparison\n    columns:\n    - Metric\n    - Original (CP labels)\n    - AdvBench (binary)\n    - Match\n    rows:\n    - - CR-composite layer\n      - L0 (0%)\n      - L2 (6.5%)\n      - Both shallow\n    - - Threshold layer\n      - L14 (45%)\n      - L14 (45%)\n      - Identical\n    - - Layer gap\n      - 14 layers\n      - 12 layers\n      - Both >=8\n    - - HS bal_acc (deep)\n      - '0.810'\n      - '0.762'\n      - Both in [0.72,0.82]\n    - - HS-text prec delta\n      - +22.4pp\n      - +18.3pp\n      - Both in [10,25]\n    - - CR ratio (shallow/deep)\n      - '2.50'\n      - '2.32'\n      - Both in [1.5,3.0]\n    - - HB pass rate\n      - 3/3\n      - 3/3\n      - Both >=0.67\n  - title: HS vs Text at Threshold Layer L14 (AdvBench)\n    columns:\n    - Modality\n    - bal_acc\n    - Precision\n    - FPR\n    - Coverage\n    rows:\n    - - HS (L14)\n      - '0.762'\n      - '0.677'\n      - '0.155'\n      - '0.586'\n    - - Text (L14)\n      - '0.661'\n      - '0.494'\n      - '0.283'\n      - '0.529'\n    - - Delta\n      - +10.1pp\n      - +18.3pp\n      - -12.8pp\n      - +5.7pp\n    - - Bootstrap p\n      - '0.005'\n      - '0.002'\n      - '0.008'\n      - '-'\n    - - HB pass\n      - Y\n      - Y\n      - Y\n      - '-'\n  - title: Cosine Distance by Layer Depth (AdvBench)\n    columns:\n    - Layer\n    - Depth%\n    - Mean Cosine Dist\n    - Crossing Rate\n    - Interpretation\n    rows:\n    - - L2\n      - 6.5%\n      - '0.038'\n      - '0.44'\n      - Compressed → noisy crossings\n    - - L8\n      - 25.8%\n      - '0.062'\n      - '0.31'\n      - Intermediate\n    - - L14\n      - 45.2%\n      - '0.091'\n      - '0.19'\n      - Expanded → stable predictions\n    - - L20\n      - 64.5%\n      - '0.105'\n      - '0.16'\n      - Deep → most stable\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Left: Layer depth vs crossing rate curve (AdvBench), overlaid with original dataset\n    curve. Both show monotonically decreasing CR with depth, near-identical shape.'\n  - 'Right: 5-metric layer selection comparison, original vs AdvBench. Side-by-side\n    bar chart showing CR-composite selects shallow in both datasets, threshold metrics\n    select deep in both.'\n  - 'Appendix: Full 32-layer heatmap (metric × layer) for AdvBench, analogous to original\n    dataset Figure X.'\n  analysis: \"AdvBench replication是best tier的核心产出。 All 8 key metrics落在target range内。Pattern\\\n    \\ match = complete。\\n论文影响： (1) Main text加一句：'Layer selection bias replicates on\\\n    \\ AdvBench with fundamentally different labeling (binary jailbreak/safe vs step-level\\\n    \\ safety state), confirming it as a geometric property of the model representation\\\n    \\ rather than a dataset-specific artifact.' (2) Appendix加完整table（上面Table 1-4）。\\\n    \\ (3) C1 claim升级：不再需要'single dataset caveat'。 (4) Reviewer concern 'bias是你数据集的artifact'\\\n    \\ 被直接堵死。\\nDream score从3.0升至~3.2： - Methodological contribution strengthened (3.0\\\n    \\ → 3.3) - Empirical validation broadened (single → cross-dataset) - Rebuttal\\\n    \\ surface reduced (one fewer major weakness) - 但不足以达到3.5 Conference因为：novelty仍是empirical\\\n    \\ study，\\n  不是new method；32B caveats仍存在。\"\n","numLines":1016,"startLine":1,"totalLines":1016}}}
