{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01HNbJDK4CACqm4VWi6TWg9X","type":"tool_result","content":"41:    \\item \\textbf{Data:} We use HarmThoughts, a publicly available benchmark with step-level safety annotations, and AdvBench~\\citep{advbench} for cross-dataset geometric validation. No new data collection was performed.\n180:[Omitted long matching line]\n183:\\label{app:advbench_cp}\n185:We analyze R1-8B behavior on 388 substantive-response AdvBench~\\citep{advbench} traces (of 520 total) to characterize a boundary condition for the CP framework (\\cref{tab:advbench_boundary}).\n191:\\label{tab:advbench_boundary}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_013X3Sy2Z23u1dyGgpTwNcaf","session_id":"8f0c6665-94b6-4b25-a480-e39988e7cc27","uuid":"d221bcf3-4269-4f32-a255-b47cadac62e6","timestamp":"2026-05-22T09:51:21.550Z"}
